Oh. Why didn't you say so sooner?

In that case, assuming both binaries are save-compatible (no exotic 
patches, etc.), you should just need to copy the save file from the 
first machine's save directory (the same place as the binary by 
default, can be changed via the 'defaults.nh' file), drop it into the 
second machine's save directory, and rename the first part to the 
username you want to use it under (the names are in the format "<user>-
<charactername>.NetHack-saved-game" -- change the '<user>' part 
appropriately).

